{"ref":"BDB, הֲדַרְעֶ֫זֶר","hw":"הֲדַרְעֶ֫זֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַרְעֶ֫זֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> a king of Aram <span dir=\"rtl\">(צוֹבָה)</span> defeated by David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.16\">2 S 10:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.19\">19</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.16\">1 Ch 19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.19\">19</a>; also <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.3\">1 Ch 18:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.10\">10</a> & <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַרְע֑זֶר</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.10\">10</a>; all erron. for <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַדְעֶזֶר</span> (q.v.), although 𝔊 throughout Ἁδρααζαρ.","next":"BDB, הָהּ","prev":"BDB, הֲדֹרָם"}